# JetBrains Starter's IDE installations, configs and screenshots for testIdeUi.
out/ide-tests/

# The compiler this plugin runs against, when it is placed in the project root rather than
# named by $FLIX_JAR. Root-anchored: gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar is committed on
# purpose, and a bare `flix.jar` rule would be the only thing standing between a 36 MB
# compiler build and `git add -A`.
/flix.jar

# Local, per-machine agent settings. The shared ones live in .claude/settings.json.
.claude/settings.local.json

# JetBrains Starter writes an Allure result per IDE exception seen during testIdeUi, at the
# repository root rather than under build/. They are a record of one run on one machine -- a
# failed `flixUiSmoke` here is a stack trace from the IDE under test, not a fixture.
/allure-results/

# JVM crash artefacts. A 3.3 GB heap dump reached a commit once, by way of `git add -A`, and
# GitHub refuses any push carrying it -- 100 MB is the limit -- so the whole branch was unpushable
# until that commit was rewritten. Never again by accident.
*.hprof
hs_err_pid*.log
replay_pid*.log
